# DailyBriefFlow

> Lede 0.6.0's docs for DailyBriefFlow, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/daily-brief.md

A hero flow for a daily brief: the day's summary, then cards that link onward, then sections that open in place to their rows.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/daily-brief
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md), [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md), [`disclosure`](disclosure.md), [`list`](list.md), [`page-header`](page-header.md) and [`summary-card`](summary-card.md). The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.6.0/daily-brief.json.

